WITHIN THE RUSSIAN ARTILLERY BASE. 

2ND AND 3RD PLTS ARE TO ASSUME COURSE HEADINGS OF 202ø SOUTH BY 
SOUTH WEST. YOUR FIRST TARGETS ARE DUG IN FUEL CONTAINMENT UNITS 
CI-3 INTELLIGENCE HAS ISSUED A DIRECTIVE THAT THESE UNITS ARE 
