2ND AND 3RD PLTS ARE FURTHER AUTHORIZED TO RIDE IN SUPPORT OF 1ST
PLT. SHOULD 1ST PLT FAIL IN ITS MISSION ORDERS, 2ND AND 3RD PLTS
ARE TO ELIMINATE REMAINING TARGETS. 
